CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11 --unwind 6 --no-unwinding-assertions
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^no body for callee$
--
std::set reverse iteration uses std::_Rb_tree_decrement (a libstdc++
compiled-library helper); CBMC models it as the in-order predecessor over the
BST, with the header special case.  The insert model colours ordinary nodes
black so the header (red) is correctly recognised.
